From: Ken Russell <kbr@chromium.org>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 16:05:41 -0700
Subject: Add split_level_0_pbo_full_sub_image_2d workaround.

This is the validating command decoder version of the similar ANGLE
workaround.

If uploading the full level 0 of a texture from a PBO via
glTexSubImage2D, split the upload into two.

Apply this workaround to Imagination's drivers. Note the validating
command decoder doesn't have support for conditioning this on driver
version, and I'm not adding that because the validating command
decoder will be removed before the workaround is obsoleted.

Bug: 496807874
Change-Id: I86bd95e856b064ef7b916b53f5cdca23404984bd
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8076418
Commit-Queue: Kenneth Russell <kbr@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1660582}

